Unfortunately there is still the problem with the encoding.
Now I use this to convert my corpus:

textCorpus = tm_map(textCorpus, content_transformer(function(x) iconv(x, to="ISO-8859-2", sub='byte')), mc.cores=1)

Are there any better encoding?

Adam

